# Google Maps API Configuration
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here

# Note: Replace 'your_google_maps_api_key_here' with your actual Google Maps API key
# Get your API key from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# Make sure to enable the following APIs:
# - Maps SDK for iOS
# - Maps SDK for Android  
# - Places API
# - Geocoding API
# - Directions API

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Replace the placeholder value with your actual API key
# 3. The .env file is in .gitignore and won't be committed to git
